{
  "description": "Agent fix loop — evaluate a program and, when it does not validate, ask the model for a repair. VALIDATE_PROGRAM { program } runs `program/eval` (the 0-error / 0-warning gate, written to the workspace's orbitals/ on success): a valid program emits PROGRAM_VALID { behavior }; an invalid one hands the validator's issues to `call-service llm generate` and emits FIX_PROPOSED { issues, fix } with the model's repair instructions. Headless apart from a status line.",
